---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Academics | University Practice SHS" description="Explore the academic experience and learning environment at University Practice Senior High School, Cape Coast.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Academics" title="Learning that opens possibilities." description="An introduction to the school's academic life, learning environment and commitment to the growth of every student." />
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow"><span></span> The learning experience</span><h2>Curiosity, commitment and growth.</h2><p>Academic life is at the heart of the school experience. This section will provide students, families and the wider community with accurate information about programmes, departments and learning support.</p></div><div class="academics-grid"><article><span class="academics-icon">01</span><h3>Academic programmes</h3><p>Official programme and elective combinations, with guidance on subject pathways.</p></article><article><span class="academics-icon">02</span><h3>Departments</h3><p>Profiles of academic departments, subject areas and their contribution to learning.</p></article><article><span class="academics-icon">03</span><h3>Learning facilities</h3><p>Information about classrooms, laboratories, library facilities and other learning spaces.</p></article><article><span class="academics-icon">04</span><h3>Student development</h3><p>Academic support, clubs, competitions and activities that extend learning beyond lessons.</p></article></div><div class="verification-note"><strong>Programme information awaiting school confirmation</strong><p>To avoid publishing incorrect admissions or programme guidance, the current elective programmes, subject combinations and department details will be added after verification by the school's academic leadership.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--wash"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow"><span></span> Beyond the classroom</span><h2 class="page-heading">A complete school experience.</h2><p class="body-copy">Learning also happens through leadership, creativity, collaboration, sport, culture and service. The website will help the school share these activities and celebrate the people who make them possible.</p><a class="button button--outline" href="/news/">Read school stories <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="academic-art"><div class="academic-art__book">KNOWLEDGE<br/><span>IN ACTION</span></div><div class="academic-art__line academic-art__line--one"></div><div class="academic-art__line academic-art__line--two"></div></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
<style>
.academics-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:34px}.academics-grid article{padding:23px 20px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;background:white}.academics-icon{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--mint);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--green);font:800 .9rem Manrope}.academics-grid h3{font:800 1rem Manrope;color:var(--navy);margin:18px 0 8px}.academics-grid p,.body-copy{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted)}.verification-note{margin-top:22px;padding:18px 20px;border-radius:12px;background:#fff8e8;border:1px solid #f1dfb8}.verification-note strong{font-size:.85rem;color:#735a27}.verification-note p{font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.6;color:#826f4b;margin:8px 0 0}.academic-art{height:350px;border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#dcebe3,#eff4e9);position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center}.academic-art__book{position:relative;z-index:1;width:220px;height:170px;background:#0a6446;border-radius:12px 28px 12px 28px;color:white;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;font:800 1.4rem/1.3 Manrope;box-shadow:15px 22px 0 #082b461c;transform:rotate(-7deg)}.academic-art__book span{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#a6e2bd}.academic-art__line{position:absolute;border:1px solid #fff;width:390px;height:390px;border-radius:50%}.academic-art__line--two{width:480px;height:480px}.verification-note{max-width:100%}@media(max-width:900px){.academics-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:620px){.academics-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
